  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;be the sum of the first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> term of the series :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to</p>"
