    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
